import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 717 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Increment-Development and Resource-Creation Post","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 717 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones' Post Duties · Increment-Development and Resource-Creation Post","no":717,"module":4,"tags":["Post Duties","Increment Development","Resource Creation","New-Manual Iteration","Civilizational Engineering"],"related":["10-300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview","61-Multiplication-Fruit Engineering Application","04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0717_模块4-增量开发与资源创造岗.md","filePath":"en/0717_模块4-增量开发与资源创造岗.md"}`),a={name:"en/0717_模块4-增量开发与资源创造岗.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,d,u){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-717-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-increment-development-and-resource-creation-post" tabindex="-1">Entry 717 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Increment-Development and Resource-Creation Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-717-hyper-multiverse-strong-ones-post-duties-·-increment-development-and-resource-creation-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 717 | Hyper-Multiverse Strong Ones&#39; Post Duties · Increment-Development and Resource-Creation Post&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 61, 04</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-if-no-new-mine-is-opened-we-can-only-divide-the-old-cake" tabindex="-1">Introduction: if no new mine is opened, we can only divide the old cake <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-if-no-new-mine-is-opened-we-can-only-divide-the-old-cake" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: if no new mine is opened, we can only divide the old cake&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Of the nine posts, the most &quot;outward-facing&quot; is the Increment-Development and Resource-Creation Post. Its core proposition is: <strong>the anti-predation axiom says &quot;develop increments, do not consume stock&quot; — then where do increments come from?</strong> The answer is this post. It does not maintain existing laws, does not guide existing Myriad Ranks, does not audit existing data — it creates new cultivation resources, new manual systems, new civilizational engineering, letting the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s total flow continuously expand. This almost does not exist in old web novels: old web-novel strong ones all divide the cake; no one truly makes a new cake.</p><p>Six top-level axioms in this entry converge into the word &quot;increment&quot;: the anti-predation axiom is this post&#39;s parent law — stock predation is forbidden, so someone must develop increments; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires newly developed resources be equally open to all beings; the collective ascension axiom requires increments invested to drive whole uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires new development not disturb existing causality; the law-first axiom requires newly developed products be compatible with the existing law network.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-post-positioning-myriad-ranks-new-cake-baker" tabindex="-1">I. Post Positioning: Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;New-Cake Baker&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-post-positioning-myriad-ranks-new-cake-baker" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Post Positioning: Myriad Ranks&#39; &quot;New-Cake Baker&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Increment-Development Post transcended ones&#39; work is to develop new flow sources for the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle. Specifically three fronts:</p><h3 id="_1-1-new-energy-source-development" tabindex="-1">1.1 New Energy-Source Development <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-new-energy-source-development" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 New Energy-Source Development&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s cosmos keeps expanding; new planes, new cosmoses, new law regions keep emerging. Increment-Development Post transcended ones:</p><ul><li>Survey newly emerged planes&#39; energy characteristics;</li><li>Design schemes to safely connect new-plane energy into the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle;</li><li>Develop new energy-conversion technologies, converting energy that cannot be directly used into cultivation-usable energy.</li></ul><p>The Multiplication Fruit (Documents 16, 61) is a classic case of increment development — technologizing the One Piece world&#39;s multiplication ability into hundred-fold deduction amplification is itself a successful increment development.</p><h3 id="_1-2-new-manual-iteration" tabindex="-1">1.2 New-Manual Iteration <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-new-manual-iteration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 New-Manual Iteration&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The 300-set Origin Cultivation System is not finalized. Increment-Development Post transcended ones:</p><ul><li>Identify existing systems&#39; bottlenecks in practice;</li><li>Design new manual branches and new combination paths;</li><li>Verify new branches&#39; safety through hundred-fold deduction;</li><li>After testing passes, add new branches to the 300-set system public library.</li></ul><p>This iteration lets the 300-set system evolve forever — it is not a fixed &quot;manual list,&quot; but a living, continuously growing cultivation-knowledge base.</p><h3 id="_1-3-new-civilizational-engineering-design" tabindex="-1">1.3 New Civilizational-Engineering Design <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-new-civilizational-engineering-design" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 New Civilizational-Engineering Design&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Cultivation is not only an individual affair. Increment-Development Post transcended ones also design civilizational-level engineering:</p><ul><li>New anchor-hardware schemes;</li><li>New cross-plane communication protocols;</li><li>New joint-contracting allocation algorithms;</li><li>New symbiotic-education curriculum systems.</li></ul><p>Every civilizational engineering landing pushes Myriad Ranks&#39; uplift ceiling up one layer.</p><h2 id="ii-why-increments-are-perpetual-construction-s-engine" tabindex="-1">II. Why Increments Are Perpetual Construction&#39;s Engine <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-increments-are-perpetual-construction-s-engine" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why Increments Are Perpetual Construction&#39;s Engine&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Of the nine posts, the Maintenance, Supervision, Correction, and Deliberation posts are all &quot;preservation&quot; posts — they keep existing civilization from collapsing. The Guidance, Cross-Plane, and Training posts are &quot;connection&quot; posts — they connect Myriad Ranks more tightly. <strong>Only the Increment-Development Post and the New-Cosmos Frontier Post (719) are truly &quot;production&quot; posts</strong> — they create new things.</p><p>The key to perpetual construction being &quot;perpetual&quot; is here: if there is only preservation and connection, no production, the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle&#39;s total flow will one day hit a ceiling, then stagnate, then shrink, then regress. The Increment-Development Post is the one who continuously pushes the ceiling up. He pushes once; Myriad Ranks have more space; pushes again; more space. This &quot;push the ceiling&quot; action never stops, and perpetual construction truly holds.</p><h2 id="iii-the-difference-between-increment-development-and-predatory-development" tabindex="-1">III. The Difference Between Increment Development and Predatory Development <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-difference-between-increment-development-and-predatory-development" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Difference Between Increment Development and Predatory Development&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Increment development is not &quot;digging new mines everywhere.&quot; It is fundamentally different from predatory development:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Increment Development</th><th>Predatory Development</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Goal</td><td>Expand Myriad-Origin two-way cycle total flow</td><td>Grab others&#39; stock into own hands</td></tr><tr><td>Method</td><td>Develop new energy sources, new manuals, new engineering</td><td>Devour, monopolize, exploit</td></tr><tr><td>Consequence</td><td>Myriad Ranks benefit whole</td><td>The strong get richer, the poor get poorer</td></tr><tr><td>Causal impact</td><td>Add new flow, do not disturb old causality</td><td>Draw out stock, distort old causality</td></tr><tr><td>Alaya record</td><td>Positive contribution</td><td>Predation record</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Increment-Development Post transcended ones must constantly remind themselves: <strong>we are making a new cake, not grabbing the cake.</strong> Once some development project begins to &quot;consume stock&quot; rather than &quot;create increments,&quot; Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision auto-issues an early warning, requiring the project to pause and be reassessed.</p><h2 id="iv-division-of-labor-with-the-new-cosmos-frontier-post" tabindex="-1">IV. Division of Labor with the New-Cosmos Frontier Post <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-division-of-labor-with-the-new-cosmos-frontier-post" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Division of Labor with the New-Cosmos Frontier Post&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Increment-Development Post and the New-Cosmos Frontier Post (719) closely cooperate, but with different divisions:</p><ul><li>The Increment-Development Post develops new resources, new manuals, new engineering <strong>within existing cosmoses</strong>;</li><li>The New-Cosmos Frontier Post weaves new laws in cosmoses <strong>not yet existing</strong>;</li><li>New laws tested by the Frontier Post are handed to the Increment-Development Post to design into usable manual branches;</li><li>Existing-law insufficiency discovered by the Increment-Development Post is handed to the Frontier Post to design new supplementary laws.</li></ul><p>The two posts form a closed loop of &quot;raise demand — frontier-verify — land and apply.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: increment development lets every new unit of computing power directly convert into Myriad-Rank-usable resources, not idle</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: increment development is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s positive practice — since we cannot grab stock, we make a new cake</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style strong ones divide the cake; Heng Yuan Zhou-style strong ones bake the cake; the former makes Myriad Ranks involute; the latter makes Myriad Ranks grow</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: newly developed manuals, energy, and engineering are all open to 99% of clans through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: new manual branches, new energy-conversion technologies, new civilizational-engineering schemes all enter the library, no private hoarding</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Increment-Development Post is perpetual construction&#39;s engine. It is unromantic, undramatic, without protagonist aura; it simply, day after day, delivers new cultivation resources, new manual branches, and new civilizational engineering to Myriad Ranks. <strong>Precisely because of such people, the Myriad-Origin two-way cycle may spin larger and larger, and Heng Yuan Zhou may truly be &quot;perpetual.&quot;</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300-Set Origin Cultivation System Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/61-倍增果实工程化应用.html">Entry 61 · Multiplication-Fruit Engineering Application</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/11-推演迭代体系详解.html">Entry 11 · Deduction-Iteration System Details</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',37)])])}const m=n(a,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
